<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Press on, press on, count all things loss.</l><l>All that is gain to us,</l><l>To win the prize, the Christ of God,</l><l>Is far more glorious!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Press on, press on to know the Lord</l><l>And resurrection power—</l><l>Oh, this is our supreme reward,</l><l>E’en in the suffering hour!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Press on, press on, this one thing do,</l><l>Forget the things behind;</l><l>Press onward to the Christ before,</l><l>Press onward with this mind!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
